neral Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Grace T  McKee MD Signed On  20 REMOVED_MONTH 02 at 13 39 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  right lumpectomy  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm portion of yellow fibrofatty breast tissue  Two sutures are present which are designated short superior and long lateral  The specimen is inked as follows  blue anterior  black deep  green superior  and yellow inferior  The specimen is serially sectioned lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm white tan solid mass extending to the posterior black inked margin and coming to within 0 2cm of the blue inked anterior margin and 0 6cm of the green inked superior margin  The mass is entirely submitted in cassettes A C  Representative sections of the breast tissue lateral to the mass are submitted in cassette D  Representative sections of the breast tissue medial to the mass is submitted in cassette E  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin superior half  are three unoriented yellow fibrofatty breast tissue fragments measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassette F  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and  final shaved margin inferior half  are three unoriented yellow fibrofatty breast tissue fragments measuring in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted in cassettes G I  Resident  CHAD SOUPIR  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    